# 작업 Capability 하네스 (Cursor)

이 규칙은 생성물이다. 고치려면 `capabilities/`·`profiles/`·`workflows/`를 고치고
`npm run generate`를 돌린다.

## Capability

| id | requires | produces |
|---|---|---|
| `implementation` | specification.contract · specification.completed | implementation.patch · implementation.summary · implementation.completed |
| `requirements` | — | requirements.spec · requirements.completed |
| `review` | specification.contract · specification.completed · implementation.completed · implementation.patch | review.verdict · review.completed |
| `specification` | requirements.spec · requirements.completed | specification.contract · specification.testids · specification.completed |

